  "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Create a transparent game sprite sheet of Princess Amber matching two reference images: long auburn hair,brown eyes,fair skin,gold flower tiara,orange princess gown with black sleeves and white flowers outlined black,orange shoes,navy outlines. Adapt full gown folds for dance. Covered modest costume throughout; if raised skirt reveals legs use opaque orange leggings matching outfit. Same head/torso proportions, same outfit, joyful extreme expressive poses. Exactly nine full-body figures arranged 3 columns by 3 rows, generous transparent gutters, no text, background, floor, shadows, effects, props or extra characters. Ordered left-to-right then top-to-bottom: 1 disco: right arm points up-left at45degrees,index up,left hand hip,hips right,bent knee,cocky grin; 2 airborne star jump: arms legs huge X,hair flying,open WHEE smile,feet elevated; 3 hula: both arms stretched to right at shoulder height,soft wrists,hips far left,knees bent,eyes closed smile; 4 cartwheel preparation: side-on lunge,arms overhead,excited grin; 5 cartwheel fully upside-down: both palms on floor,straight arms,legs wide V above body,hair hanging down,upside-down happy face; 6 cancan: one straight leg kicks up past head,other straight supporting leg,hands hold skirt hem apart,lean back,open smile; 7 floor splits: legs stretched straight in opposite directions flat on floor,torso upright,arms big V,surprised proud happy face; 8 moonwalk facing screen-right: front foot flat,back heel raised knee bent,lean back,one hand forehead tipping imaginary hat,no hat; 9 moonwalk same with feet swapped. Keep all nine heads and torsos the SAME scale; wide/inverted poses naturally lower or wider, never shrink them to fit. Full figure and every shoe,hand,hair strand,crown inside its cell.",
